{"4655130":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Heaven Miner","steam_appid":4655130,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heaven Miner is a lighthearted and adorable small-scale game where players help angels find outfits, form bonds with angels of different personalities, and build a harem!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this process, improve your abilities and form bonds with angels!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4655130\/extras\/b91a07ffbf08b8a7cb11e3028fa3d5f0.avif?t=1793758448\" width=500 height=116 \/><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4655130\/extras\/07c51e8eb5b5984871151c9512c85003.poster.avif?t=1793758448\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4655130\/extras\/07c51e8eb5b5984871151c9512c85003.webm?t=1793758448\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4655130\/extras\/07c51e8eb5b5984871151c9512c85003.mp4?t=1793758448\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4655130\/extras\/f0964553e42f62acef6b5e93242fb07e.poster.avif?t=1793758448\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4655130\/extras\/f0964553e42f62acef6b5e93242fb07e.webm?t=1793758448\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4655130\/extras\/f0964553e42f62acef6b5e93242fb07e.mp4?t=1793758448\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\